WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.366
MRI monitoring in multiple sclerosis.

2
00:00:03.816 --> 00:00:07.496
When to repeat MRI and which findings signal disease activity.

3
00:00:07.946 --> 00:00:11.058
Early treatment reduces relapses and new lesions.

4
00:00:11.508 --> 00:00:14.329
Options range from moderate to high efficacy.

5
00:00:14.779 --> 00:00:19.829
Regular clinical review and MRI identify breakthrough activity and the need to escalate.

6
00:00:20.279 --> 00:00:25.748
Fatigue, bladder symptoms, spasticity and mood need attention alongside disease control.
